{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mine, mine, mine ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've ventured into the depths of the caves with one goal\u2014getting rich. Starting with nothing, you must race against time to meet your daily objectives by acquiring new gear and abilities. Discover powerful synergies between dozens of unique items and build your way to fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.poster.avif?t=1752781758\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.webm?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.mp4?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Race with time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day, you'll explore a randomly generated cave, trying to collect as much money as possible before time runs out. Anything you leave behind will be lost forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.poster.avif?t=1752781758\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.webm?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.mp4?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore multiple terrains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through diverse biomes, each filled with unique resources and obstacles that challenge your path to wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/5c264c20bc346e75be2da6025bbb81c0.avif?t=1752781758\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synergize your items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with countless item combinations to create powerful synergies. Plan your builds, develop strategies, and do whatever it takes to achieve success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The demo includes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">over 30 items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a full picture of the target gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627460?t=1752781758","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627460?t=1752781758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/a4eea130715909cbe6ed2f08aae5c527fe8b6092/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752781758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/a4eea130715909cbe6ed2f08aae5c527fe8b6092/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752781758","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mine, mine, mine ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've ventured into the depths of the caves with one goal\u2014getting rich. Starting with nothing, you must race against time to meet your daily objectives by acquiring new gear and abilities. Discover powerful synergies between dozens of unique items and build your way to fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.poster.avif?t=1752781758\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.webm?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.mp4?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Race with time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day, you'll explore a randomly generated cave, trying to collect as much money as possible before time runs out. Anything you leave behind will be lost forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.poster.avif?t=1752781758\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.webm?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.mp4?t=1752781758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore multiple terrains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through diverse biomes, each filled with unique resources and obstacles that challenge your path to wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/extras/5c264c20bc346e75be2da6025bbb81c0.avif?t=1752781758\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synergize your items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with countless item combinations to create powerful synergies. Plan your builds, develop strategies, and do whatever it takes to achieve success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The demo includes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">over 30 items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a full picture of the target gameplay</p></li></ul>","developers":["Mateusz Pientka"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3621320","name":"Oreflux"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627460/5376ae458bd0f95ef1682ee08db8c868c4938c95/header.jpg?t=1752781758","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168172,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168172/movie480.mp4?t=1752680509","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168172/movie_max.mp4?t=1752680509"},"name":"Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168172/bee70de4f728d13ad0481a0c7a74a82c81a0a580/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752680509","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168172/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752680509","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168172/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752680509"}}],"name":"Oreflux Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5 or equvalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2